            "id": 132671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İstek verisinin <code>username</code> özelliğine eriş.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.post(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/players&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestData = req.body;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" username = requestData.username;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(username);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"body\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"DauT\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>requestData</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>username</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gönderilen kullanıcı adını bu callback'te saklanan gövdeden oku, ardından yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.post(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/players&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requestData = req.body;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" username = requestData.username;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(username);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"password\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"res.body\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req.params\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"DauT\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>requestData</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>username</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
